# No tunnels, no Cloudflare

Never run Expo (or anything else) through a tunnel or Cloudflare. Tunnel
providers (ngrok, Cloudflare Tunnel) are not on the approved software list.

```bash
# ❌ BAD — tunnel / Cloudflare traffic
npx expo start --tunnel
node node_modules/.bin/expo start --tunnel
cloudflared tunnel run

# ✅ GOOD — LAN / localhost only
npx expo start
npx expo start --localhost
npx expo start --clear
```

Rules:
- Never pass `--tunnel` to `expo start`; use LAN (default) or `--localhost`.
- Do not install or invoke `@expo/ngrok`, `ngrok`, or `cloudflared`.
- Only use tools from the approved software list; if a task seems to need an
  unapproved tool, ask instead of installing it.
